# StockSense Database Migrations

Alembic uses the async SQLAlchemy URL from `DATABASE_URL` in the backend settings. Keep credentials in `backend/.env`, never in migration files.

From the `backend` directory, apply migrations with:

```powershell
venv\Scripts\alembic.exe upgrade head
```

Generate a migration after changing SQLAlchemy models with:

```powershell
venv\Scripts\alembic.exe revision --autogenerate -m "describe the schema change"
```

Review generated migration code before applying it. Production startup does not create tables automatically; apply migrations before starting the application.